{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52792","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 张博望","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫绶朝中贵，黄冠物外高。\n孰能知止足，君独避尘劳。\n已晓青霞志，方从碧落遨。\n轩车傥来物，从此贱吾曹。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张博望","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}